    model : load ffn_gate_up_exps scales (#32657)
    
    * model: load `ffn_gate_up_exps` scales
    
    The generic scale pass loads per-expert scales for ffn_gate_exps,
    ffn_up_exps and ffn_down_exps but not for the merged ffn_gate_up_exps.
    Load ~ffn_gate_up_exps_s there~ and expose it as ffn_up_exps_s ~when the layer
    has no separate up tensor,~ since build_moe_ffn applies up_exps_s to the
    merged gate_up output. Inkling 2 now passes the expert scales to
    build_moe_ffn like the other MoE models.
    
    * Update src/llama-model.cpp
    
    Co-authored-by: Sigbjørn Skjæret <sigbjorn.skjaeret@huggingface.co>
    
    * Update src/llama-model.h
    
    Co-authored-by: Sigbjørn Skjæret <sigbjorn.skjaeret@huggingface.co>
    
